{"starts": [0.0, 6.064541, 10.394999, 15.725456000000001, 22.278663, 31.411412, 35.525953, 41.295036], "total": 47.835494, "segs": [{"text": "¿Qué pasa si no duermes durante once días? Spoiler: tu cerebro empieza a inventar cosas.", "words": [["Qué", 0.095458, 0.220458], ["pasa", 0.231833, 0.493208], ["si", 0.504541, 0.640916], ["no", 0.652291, 0.788666], ["duermes", 0.8, 1.152291], ["durante", 1.163625, 1.493166], ["once", 1.504541, 1.754541], ["días", 1.765916, 2.197749], ["Spoiler", 2.988625, 3.556791], ["tu", 3.806833, 3.909124], ["cerebro", 3.920458, 4.249999], ["empieza", 4.261375, 4.670458], ["a", 4.681833, 4.727291], ["inventar", 4.738625, 5.193166], ["cosas", 5.204541, 5.704541]], "dur": 6.024541}, {"text": "A las veinticuatro horas, tu atención ya cae como si hubieras bebido alcohol.", "words": [["A", 0.095458, 0.209083], ["las", 0.220458, 0.390916], ["veinticuatro", 0.402291, 0.959124], ["horas", 0.970458, 1.311374], ["tu", 1.527291, 1.606832], ["atención", 1.618166, 2.095457], ["ya", 2.106833, 2.243208], ["cae", 2.254541, 2.504541], ["como", 2.515916, 2.731832], ["si", 2.743166, 2.868166], ["hubieras", 2.879541, 3.254541], ["bebido", 3.265916, 3.572749], ["alcohol", 3.584083, 3.970458]], "dur": 4.290458}, {"text": "A los tres días llegan las alucinaciones: ves cosas que no existen y desconfías de todos.", "words": [["A", 0.095458, 0.209083], ["los", 0.220458, 0.402291], ["tres", 0.413625, 0.629541], ["días", 0.640916, 0.902291], ["llegan", 0.913625, 1.186333], ["las", 1.197708, 1.334083], ["alucinaciones", 1.345458, 2.129541], ["ves", 2.390916, 2.595457], ["cosas", 2.606833, 2.959124], ["que", 2.970458, 3.084083], ["no", 3.095458, 3.243166], ["existen", 3.254541, 3.697707], ["y", 3.709083, 3.754541], ["desconfías", 3.765916, 4.402291], ["de", 4.413625, 4.504541], ["todos", 4.515916, 4.970457]], "dur": 5.290457}, {"text": "Tu cerebro se apaga por segundos sin avisarte. Son los microsueños, y pueden pillarte en cualquier momento.", "words": [["Tu", 0.09545